 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Becoming something",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something changes and becomes different, use **-아/어지다** after an adjective: 춥다 → **추워지다** (to become cold), 좋다 → **좋아지다** (to improve), 예쁘다 → **예뻐지다** (to become pretty), 크다 → **커지다** (to grow).",
      "날씨가 **추워졌어요** = the weather has become cold."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past",
     "texto": [
      "With **-았/었어요** you say the change has already happened: 쉬워지다 → **쉬워졌어요** (has become easy).",
      "It is the same change we make with 되다 (to become), but with adjectives."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
